# One line ending everywhere (2026-11-15): LF in the repository and in the
# working tree, whatever core.autocrlf says. The tree had CRLF, LF and mixed
# files side by side (Windows autocrlf checkouts next to tool-written files).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binary payloads.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.parquet binary
*.db binary
